    <item>
      <title>Swap places</title>
      <link>https://merak.run/blog/swaps/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 19 Nov 2021 00:37:20 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://merak.run/blog/swaps/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Sometimes we want to exchange tokens between them, and many times the easiest way is to use a Swap page.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Those pages connect to your wallet, like &lt;a href=&#34;https://merak.run/terms/m/metamask/&#34;&gt;Metamask&lt;/a&gt;, and ask for &lt;a href=&#34;https://merak.run/blog/tokenapprovals/&#34;&gt;approval&lt;/a&gt; for interacting with your tokens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With those interactions will allow you to select the tokens to use as source (funds) and target from a list, or via their &lt;a href=&#34;https://merak.run/terms/c/contract/&#34;&gt;contract&lt;/a&gt; so that you can exchange them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
  &lt;thead&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;th&gt;Network&lt;/th&gt;
          &lt;th&gt;URL&lt;/th&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;/thead&gt;
  &lt;tbody&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;BSC&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://pancakeswap.finance/&#34;&gt;https://pancakeswap.finance/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;xDai&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://app.honeyswap.org/&#34;&gt;https://app.honeyswap.org/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;xDai&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.baoswap.com/&#34;&gt;https://www.baoswap.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Polygon(Matic)&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://quickswap.exchange/&#34;&gt;https://quickswap.exchange/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Multichain&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://app.multichain.org/#/router&#34;&gt;https://app.multichain.org/#/router&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Token Approval URLs</title>
      <link>https://merak.run/blog/tokenapprovals/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 11 Nov 2021 22:29:12 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://merak.run/blog/tokenapprovals/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;When a wallet interacts, for example, &lt;a href=&#34;https://merak.run/terms/m/metamask/&#34;&gt;Metamask&lt;/a&gt;, it might require approvals for interaction with the wallet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sometimes, those contracts might be fraudulent or malicious and, you forget about them when time passes but still have access to your funds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can check the current approved ones via the following sites, depending on the network you&amp;rsquo;re using on your wallet:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;ethereum&#34;&gt;Ethereum&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://approved.zone/&#34;&gt;https://approved.zone/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://tac.dappstar.io/&#34;&gt;https://tac.dappstar.io/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://revoke.cash/&#34;&gt;https://revoke.cash/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://app.unrekt.net/&#34;&gt;https://app.unrekt.net/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://debank.com&#34;&gt;https://debank.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://etherscan.io/tokenapprovalchecker&#34;&gt;https://etherscan.io/tokenapprovalchecker&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;polygon&#34;&gt;Polygon&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://polygonscan.com/tokenapprovalchecker&#34;&gt;https://polygonscan.com/tokenapprovalchecker&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;binance-smart-chain&#34;&gt;Binance Smart Chain&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://bscscan.com/tokenapprovalchecker&#34;&gt;https://bscscan.com/tokenapprovalchecker&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://app.unrekt.net/&#34;&gt;https://app.unrekt.net/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;fantom&#34;&gt;Fantom&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://app.unrekt.net/&#34;&gt;https://app.unrekt.net/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;huobi-eco-chain&#34;&gt;Huobi ECO Chain&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://app.unrekt.net/&#34;&gt;https://app.unrekt.net/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
